[h3]November Quality of Life update[/h3]

[list]
[*] Copy Settings now transfers a building's temperature limits through U60's building event. PLib has been updated for the new game version.
[*] Sweep errands check each bin against the material's temperature before choosing a destination. A bin that rejects the material leaves the next eligible bin available.
[*] Reachable bins requesting the same material contribute their individual temperature ranges. This also covers different tags that share an internal hash and keeps ranges separate across parent worlds.
[/list]

[b]Fast Track compatibility[/b]

Delivery Temperature Limit runs on its own. Fast Track support is best-effort. The current beta's default pickup and reachability options depend on game APIs that changed in U60. Leave Fast Track disabled for this release. No settings combination has completed paired in-game checks.

This release targets the November Quality of Life update. Existing temperature limits use the same saved fields.
